     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hey Guys,<div><br></div><div>I am trying to debug by print. However, I am getting errors when I inject print statements into my code. </div><div>Below is my code: (I am aware there are other bugs, but I wanted to tackle one thing at a time)</div><div><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">library(rstan)<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">cat (&quot;Stan version:&quot;, stan_version(), &quot;\\n&quot;)</span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">stanmodelcode &lt;- &quot;</span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">functions {<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real inhibition(real S1,<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                    real S2, <br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                    real A1,<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                    real B1,<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                    real B2,<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                    real G1,<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                    real G2,<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                    real uhat1,<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                    real uhat2){<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real x;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    x &lt;- (A1 * S1 - B1 * uhat2 - B2 * uhat1) / (1 + G1 * uhat2 + G2 * uhat1);<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    return x;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    }</span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real gain(real cs1,<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">              real cs2,<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">              real cs3,<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">              real cs4,<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">              real cs0,<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">              real x){<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real duhat;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    duhat &lt;- fmax(0,cs1 * x + cs2 * x ^ 2 + cs3 * x ^ 3 + cs4 * x ^ 4 + cs0);<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    return duhat;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    }<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">}</span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">data {<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    int&lt;lower=0&gt; N;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real y[N];<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">}</span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">parameters {<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real&lt;lower=0&gt; A1;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real&lt;lower=0&gt; B1;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real&lt;lower=0&gt; B2;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real&lt;lower=0&gt; G1;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real&lt;lower=0&gt; G2;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real&lt;lower=0&gt; cs1;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real&lt;lower=0&gt; cs2;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real&lt;lower=0&gt; cs3;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real&lt;lower=0&gt; cs4;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real&lt;lower=0&gt; cs0;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">}</span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">model {<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    int ttotal;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    int dtsteps;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    int k;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real dt;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real S1;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real S2;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real uhat[N];<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    dt &lt;- 0.01;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    dtsteps &lt;- 50000;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    k &lt;- 1;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    A1 ~ normal(0.0365,0.00365);<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    B1 ~ normal(0.144,0.0144);<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    B2 ~ normal(0.000501,0.0000501);<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    G1 ~ normal(753,75);<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    G2 ~ normal(661,66);<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    cs1 ~ normal(1.851,0.2);<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    cs2 ~ normal(0.01,0.001);<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    cs3 ~ normal(0.01,0.001);<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    cs4 ~ normal(0.01,0.001);<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    cs0 ~ normal(0.05,0.005);<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">        for (i in 1:11)<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">            for (j in 1:i){<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                S1 &lt;- (i-1) * 0.1;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                S2 &lt;- (j-1) * 0.1;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                uhat[k] &lt;- 0;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                uhat[k+66] &lt;- 0;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                for (n in 1:dtsteps){<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                    uhat[k] &lt;- uhat[k] + dt * gain(cs1,cs2,cs3,cs4,cs0,inhibition(S1,S2,A1,B1,B2,G1,G2,uhat[k],uhat[k+66]));<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                    uhat[k + 66] &lt;- uhat[k+66] + dt * gain(cs1,cs2,cs3,cs4,cs0,inhibition(S2,S1,A1,B1,B2,G1,G2,uhat[k+66],uhat[k]));<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                    }<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                k &lt;- k + 1;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">                }<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    for (n in 1:N){<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">        y[n] ~ normal(uhat[n],0.01);<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">        }<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    }<br></span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&quot;</font></blockquote><div><br></div><div>Now, in my model block, if I insert the following comment,</div><div><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">model {<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    int ttotal;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    int dtsteps;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    int k;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real dt;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real S1;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real S2;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    real uhat[N];<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    dt &lt;- 0.001;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    dtsteps &lt;- 100000;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    k &lt;- 1;<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">    A1 ~ normal(0.0365,0.00365);<br></span><span st